      "code": "HR_ADMIN",
      "cross_product": false,
      "description": "Administers time and attendance across the organization: reads and corrects every employee's attendance, and defines the organization's shifts and field geo-fences. Deliberately built from the HRMS catalogue alone. Administers people data across the organization: reads every employee and creates, edits and transitions their records. Deliberately built from the HRMS catalogue alone \u2014 administering HR is not the same job as owning the account. Administers leave across the organization: defines leave types, grants and adjusts balances, and reads or force-cancels any employee's request. Deliberately built from the HRMS catalogue alone.",
